// Villain Def - Syndicate_Enforcer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3758298506" "When the Syndicate needs muscle they call in their Strikers. Whether it's to put the hurt on someone who has crossed the Syndicate or to rally Initiates and Adepts under them; the Strikers command respect within the Syndicate ranks."
// DisplayNames :
"P954057622" "Striker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Pyrokineticist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3994240782" "The Syndicate encourages their Adepts to advance their psychic powers, so it isn't uncommon to see Pyrokineticists within their ranks. These fiery Adepts are capable of not only hurling bolts of fire, but also stealing power from their foes to build their own."
// DisplayNames :
"P1020972457" "Pyrokineticist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Pyrokineticist_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Telekineticist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P937535520" "The Syndicate encourages their Adepts to advance their psychic powers, so it isn't uncommon to see Telekineticists within their ranks. These Adepts are capable of manipulating kinetic energy to crush their foes, but also to steal power from their foes to build their own."
// DisplayNames :
"P206388213" "Telekineticist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Telekineticist_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Suit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1839461590" "Suits are there to keep the Syndicate Initiates and Adepts in line and to make sure they don't fall prey to Mother Mayhem's Seers. They act as a sort of psychic shield for their men. The Suits are cold and calculating, one part business man, one part heartless killer."
// DisplayNames :
"P1234284576" "Suit"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Suit_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Sword_Master 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P272354440" "These Syndicate diehards were once initiates who rose through the ranks of their organization through dedication, skill and no small amount of craziness. Sword Masters can cut the very air causing blades of wind to slice at their foes from range."
// DisplayNames :
"P434843091" "Sword Master"

