// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Tub_Ci 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4236005794" "The personal bodyguard of Mr. Wu Yin, and director of security for Yin Corp. Tub Ci Tang abandoned his life as leader of the crumbling Hmong Tsoo criminal organization and has instead sworn to defend the Yin family with his life. Rumors persist about how he lost his eye, but Tub Ci has refused to confirm any of the stories."
// DisplayNames :
"P1370962095" "Tub Ci"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Wu_Yin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P868248709" "Mega Corp titan and CEO of Yin Corp, Mr. Yin is a household name. In the wake of the Hamidon Wars, Mr. Yin's hard work ethic galvanized his workers, forming the world spanning Yin Corp in a matter of a few short years. Invaluable in the reconstruction efforts, Mr. Yin enjoys a privileged life along with his daughter and heiress to the corporate throne, Penelope Yin."
// DisplayNames :
"P1276236003" "Wu Yin"

