// Villain Def - Syndicate_Charles_Monroe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1727185390" "Charles Monroe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Chance_McKnight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3775666199" "Chance McKnight is a Ministry of Information investigator working undercover in the Syndicate."
// DisplayNames :
"P1736376830" "Chance McKnight"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Masamoto 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1464666099" "Masamoto is one of the top Syndicate leaders. He has enjoyed great success in the Syndicate Corp Wars due to his own martial prowess."
// DisplayNames :
"P3473280366" "Masamoto"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Octavian 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P396381402" "Octavian Mensk has an immense following within the Syndicate. He is charismatic and intelligent, making him the perfect candidate to lead the Syndicate when the old leadership is dead."
// DisplayNames :
"P954908846" "Octavian Mensk"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Maxine 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P967194818" "Maxine is one of the top Syndicate killers. Her psychic mastery over her own body turns her into a lethal killing machine."
// DisplayNames :
"P2306690510" "Maxine"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Syndicate_Gregory_Vega 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3146959523" "Gregory Vega is the man behind the Syndicate plot to aid Metronome. Putting him down will scatter the Syndicate and slow down Metronome's plans!"
// DisplayNames :
"P3104810360" "Gregory Vega"

